WEBVTT

00:01.155 --> 00:03.811
[jaunty music]
[欢快的音乐]

00:03.880 --> 00:11.155
♪ ♪
♪ ♪
♪ ♪
♪ ♪

00:13.500 --> 00:16.259
- One more dang dab,
and she'll be done.
- 再来一张，
她会完成的。

00:16.328 --> 00:18.948
She looks fine
as cream gravy...
她看起来不错
作为奶油汁...

00:19.017 --> 00:20.845
with real working parts.
与真实的工作部件。

00:20.914 --> 00:22.707
[cannons boom]
[大炮轰鸣]

00:22.776 --> 00:23.845
[cannon balls pinging]
[炮弹声]

00:23.914 --> 00:26.776
[explosion]
[爆炸]

00:26.845 --> 00:28.569
Ah!
啊!

00:28.638 --> 00:30.535
Two weeks down the drain!
两周就这样白费了！

00:32.155 --> 00:34.638
I can't win for losing.
我不能因为输而赢。

00:35.811 --> 00:38.155
- [gulping]
- [吞咽]

00:38.224 --> 00:39.914
Thanks for the hot beverage.
谢谢你的热饮。

00:39.983 --> 00:41.259
It was just what I needed.
这正是我所需要的。

00:41.328 --> 00:44.673
[sighs]
[fog horn blows]
[叹气]
[雾号吹响]

00:44.742 --> 00:45.880
Sandy?
沙？

00:45.948 --> 00:48.638
- [chomping]
- [咀嚼]

00:48.707 --> 00:51.293
[continues chomping]
[继续咀嚼]

00:52.914 --> 00:54.362
- Yee-haw!
- 哎呀！

00:54.431 --> 00:56.121
You look madder than fried egg
on a neck bone.
你看起来比煎鸡蛋还疯狂
在颈骨上。

00:56.190 --> 00:57.431
- [chomping]
- [咀嚼]

00:57.500 --> 00:59.914
Don't even attempt a Texas
saying.
甚至不要尝试德克萨斯州
说。

00:59.983 --> 01:01.638
- Sorry.
What's going on?
- 对不起。
这是怎么回事？

01:01.707 --> 01:04.017
- I wanted to win the ship-in-
a-bottle contest tomorrow,
-我想赢得入船-
明天的瓶子比赛，

01:04.086 --> 01:06.224
but every one I make
is a disaster.
但我做的每一个
是一场灾难。

01:06.293 --> 01:09.500
My kiddie boat in a baby bottle
capsized.
我的小船装在婴儿奶瓶里
翻船了。

01:09.569 --> 01:12.604
My raft in an inflatable
bottle deflated.
我的充气筏
瓶子瘪了。

01:12.673 --> 01:16.742
And my tanker in a water cooler
bottle had an oil spill.
我的油罐车在饮水机里
瓶子漏油了。

01:16.811 --> 01:19.224
Now I'm all fresh out
of bottles.
现在我焕然一新
瓶子。

01:19.293 --> 01:21.466
- [grunts]
- [咕哝]

01:21.535 --> 01:23.811
Mm...mm.
嗯……嗯。

01:23.880 --> 01:25.224
Mm.
毫米。

01:25.293 --> 01:27.052
Whoop. Here's a fresh bottle
you can use.
哎哟。这是一瓶新鲜的
你可以使用。

01:27.121 --> 01:28.707
- Did you just--
- 你刚刚是不是——

01:28.776 --> 01:30.017
- [gasps]
- [喘气]

01:30.086 --> 01:31.155
I did!
我做到了！

01:31.224 --> 01:32.190
[whimpers]
[呜咽]

01:32.259 --> 01:33.776
The secret formula!
秘密配方！

01:33.845 --> 01:37.914
[panting]
[气喘吁吁]

01:37.983 --> 01:39.948
- Flight 291 is now boarding.
- 291 航班现已登机。

01:40.017 --> 01:42.914
All passengers can proceed
to gate four.
所有乘客均可继续
到四号门。

01:42.983 --> 01:44.397
[indistinct radio chatter]
[模糊的无线电喋喋不休]

01:44.466 --> 01:47.845
[plane engines whirring]
[飞机引擎呼呼地响]

01:47.914 --> 01:50.052
- [yelps]
- [尖叫声]

01:50.121 --> 01:53.017
[dramatic music]
[戏剧音乐]

01:53.086 --> 01:54.983
♪ ♪
♪ ♪
♪ ♪
♪ ♪

01:55.052 --> 01:58.155
[groans]
- Ah!
[呻吟]
- 啊！

01:58.224 --> 02:00.155
- Give me that.
- 给我那个。

02:02.707 --> 02:05.604
[grunts]
[咕哝]

02:05.673 --> 02:09.086
[yelps]
[尖叫声]

02:09.155 --> 02:10.397
[grunts]
[咕哝]

02:10.466 --> 02:11.914
[groans]
[呻吟]

02:11.983 --> 02:13.673
Hoo. That was close.
呼。那很接近了。

02:15.673 --> 02:17.569
- Hm...
- 嗯...

02:17.638 --> 02:18.500
And done.
完成了。

02:18.569 --> 02:20.121
Did you bring me a bottle?
你给我带了一瓶吗？

02:20.190 --> 02:22.328
Uh-huh.
Blah.
嗯嗯。
废话。

02:22.397 --> 02:23.673
I borrowed one from Plankton
我从 Plankton 借了一个

02:23.742 --> 02:25.742
before riding
a fireball back here.
骑行前
一个火球回到这里。

02:25.811 --> 02:27.776
- [grunts]
- [咕哝]

02:27.845 --> 02:28.776
This won't fit.
这不适合。

02:28.845 --> 02:30.466
- Sure it will.
- 当然会。

02:30.535 --> 02:32.707
[grunts]
[咕哝]

02:32.776 --> 02:35.880
- Jump for your life!
- [yells]
- 为你的生命而跳跃！
- [大喊]

02:35.948 --> 02:38.362
[both whimpering]
[两人都呜咽]

02:40.431 --> 02:42.293
- Men overboard.
[chuckles]
- 男人落水了。
[笑声]

02:42.362 --> 02:45.293
- [chomping]
- [咀嚼]

02:47.500 --> 02:48.638
- Sandy. Uh, Sandy.
- 桑迪。呃，桑迪。

02:48.707 --> 02:50.086
I have an idea.
我有一个主意。

02:50.155 --> 02:51.638
Let's call Mr. Krabs.
我们打电话给蟹老板吧。

02:51.707 --> 02:54.259
I bet he knows all about
ships in bottles.
我打赌他知道一切
装在瓶子里的船。

02:54.328 --> 02:56.604
He was once a sailor.
他曾经是一名水手。

02:56.673 --> 02:58.466
- I don't need anybody's help.
- 我不需要任何人的帮助。

02:58.535 --> 03:01.052
Sandy Cheeks flies alone.
桑迪·奇克斯独自飞行。

03:01.121 --> 03:03.155
[box crumbles]
[盒子碎裂]

03:03.224 --> 03:05.121
All right. Call him up.
好的。给他打电话。

03:06.431 --> 03:10.328
Seriously, Mr. Krabs, I don't
see what you can teach me.
说实话，蟹老板，我不
看看你能教我什么。

03:10.397 --> 03:12.155
- First lesson is math.
- 第一节课是数学。

03:12.224 --> 03:13.914
I get half the prize money.
奖金我拿一半。

03:13.983 --> 03:15.259
- What the?
- 什么？

03:15.328 --> 03:19.397
I'll give you 100%...
of my fist!
我会给你100%...
我的拳头！

03:19.466 --> 03:21.500
- [chuckles]
50% sounds fair.
- [轻笑]
50% 听起来很公平。

03:21.569 --> 03:23.707
- Well, I do wanna win.
- 嗯，我确实想赢。

03:23.776 --> 03:25.673
Okay, 50%.
好的，50%。

03:25.742 --> 03:28.224
- First step: create the
perfect bottle.
- 第一步：创建
完美的瓶子。

03:28.293 --> 03:30.362
- My two friends working
together!
- 我的两个朋友在工作
一起！

03:30.431 --> 03:32.328
I got to get a picture of this.
我得拍张照片。

03:34.121 --> 03:35.052
Thank you!
谢谢你！

03:35.121 --> 03:36.638
- [groans]
- [呻吟]

03:37.569 --> 03:39.811
- First we build a furnace to
make the bottles.
- 首先我们建造一个熔炉
制作瓶子。

03:39.880 --> 03:41.880
- [inhales]
- [吸气]

03:41.948 --> 03:44.431
[exhales]
[呼气]

03:48.017 --> 03:50.224
Perfect and slick as a whistle.
像口哨一样完美而光滑。

03:50.293 --> 03:51.604
[blows]
[打击]

03:51.673 --> 03:53.638
- [slurps]
- [啜饮]

03:53.707 --> 03:55.086
Hm.
嗯。

03:55.155 --> 03:56.569
[glass shatters]
[玻璃碎裂]

03:56.638 --> 03:57.880
Try again.
再试一次。

03:57.948 --> 04:00.604
- [groaning]
- [呻吟]

04:00.673 --> 04:01.500
Hm?
嗯？

04:01.569 --> 04:02.948
Heh?
[glass shatters]
呵呵？
[玻璃碎裂]

04:03.017 --> 04:05.880
- Try again.
- 再试一次。

04:05.948 --> 04:07.052
- Eh?
- 呃？

04:07.121 --> 04:09.017
[glass shatters]
- Try again.
[玻璃碎裂]
- 再试一次。

04:09.086 --> 04:10.638
[glass shatters]
Try again.
[玻璃碎裂]
再试一次。

04:10.707 --> 04:12.707
[glass shatters]
Try again.
[玻璃碎裂]
再试一次。

04:12.776 --> 04:16.155
[glass shatters]
Try again.
[玻璃碎裂]
再试一次。

04:16.224 --> 04:17.914
- [panting]
- [气喘吁吁]

04:17.983 --> 04:19.431
- Mm. Mm.
- 毫米。毫米。

04:19.500 --> 04:21.086
Hmm.
Perfect!
唔。
完美的！

04:21.155 --> 04:22.259
- Phew.
- 唷。

04:22.328 --> 04:24.121
- Now we can start on the ship.
- 现在我们可以上船了。

04:24.190 --> 04:26.500
[glass shatters]
Ooh. Wait. Uh.
[玻璃碎裂]
哦。等待。呃。

04:26.569 --> 04:28.431
I wasn't supposed to break
that one, was I?
我不应该打破
那个，是我吗？

04:28.500 --> 04:31.362
- I feel like chewed-up twine.
- 我感觉就像被咀嚼过的麻线。

04:31.431 --> 04:33.052
I'm going to bed.
我要去睡觉了。

04:33.121 --> 04:35.362
And you can forget
about the prize money,
你可以忘记
关于奖金，

04:35.431 --> 04:37.776
'cause the contest is tomorrow.
因为比赛就在明天。

04:37.845 --> 04:39.914
- [spits]
- [吐口水]

04:39.983 --> 04:41.224
Tomorrow?
明天？

04:41.293 --> 04:43.604
[cries]
Me prize money.
[哭声]
我的奖金。

04:43.673 --> 04:47.983
Hey, mind if I take a crack
at the ship bottle thing?
嘿，介意我尝尝吗
船上瓶子的事？

04:48.052 --> 04:49.293
- Knock yourself out.
- 打败你自己。

04:49.362 --> 04:50.397
[door slams]
[关门声]

04:50.466 --> 04:51.880
[excited whimpers]
[兴奋的呜咽声]

04:51.948 --> 04:53.155
[sighs]
[叹气]

04:53.224 --> 04:56.362
I got nothing to work
with here.
我没什么工作可做
与这里。

04:56.431 --> 04:58.155
Ooh.
[heavenly tones]
哦。
[天籁之音]

04:58.224 --> 05:01.052
That prize money
is as good as mine.
那个奖金
和我的一样好。

05:01.121 --> 05:02.638
[chuckling]
[轻笑]

05:03.328 --> 05:05.328
- Mm.
[bright music]
- 毫米。
[明亮的音乐]

05:05.397 --> 05:07.052
[bird cawing]
[鸟叫声]

05:07.121 --> 05:10.121
[yawns]
[哈欠]

05:10.190 --> 05:12.707
[cawing continues]
Huh?
[叫声继续]
啊？

05:12.776 --> 05:13.673
[yelps]
[尖叫声]

05:13.742 --> 05:14.880
[triumphant fanfare]
[凯旋的号角]

05:14.948 --> 05:15.880
- Ahoy, matey!
- 嘿，伙计！

05:15.948 --> 05:17.811
- What is all this?
- 这一切是什么？

05:17.880 --> 05:19.914
- Hang on.
Just let me show you.
- 不挂断。
让我给你展示一下。

05:19.983 --> 05:20.914
- [yelps]
- [尖叫声]

05:20.983 --> 05:22.673
- Ta-da!
- 哒哒！

05:22.742 --> 05:25.707
It's the biggest ship
in a bottle ever.
这是最大的船
永远装在瓶子里。

05:25.776 --> 05:27.397
It's sure to win the contest.
它肯定会赢得比赛。

05:27.466 --> 05:28.914
- That's amazing, Mr. Krabs.
- 太棒了，蟹老板。

05:28.983 --> 05:31.224
You got some snap in
your old garters after all!
你有一些快照
毕竟你的旧吊袜带！

05:31.293 --> 05:32.535
Yee-haw!
呀呀！

05:32.604 --> 05:34.880
We're gonna win for sure!
- [laughs]
我们一定会赢！
- [笑]

05:34.948 --> 05:36.259
- Whoo-hoo!
- 呼呼！

05:36.328 --> 05:38.052
By the way, where'd you
get all the wood?
顺便问一下，你在哪里
得到所有的木头吗？

05:38.121 --> 05:40.845
- I chopped down your tree.
- That's great.
- 我砍倒了你的树。
- 那太棒了。

05:40.914 --> 05:41.983
You what?
你什么？

05:42.052 --> 05:42.983
Huh?
啊？

05:43.052 --> 05:47.707
[dramatic music]
[戏剧音乐]

05:47.776 --> 05:50.362
[whimpering]
- Uh-oh.
[呜咽]
- 呃哦。

05:50.431 --> 05:53.638
- Why, you low-down, no-good,
bottom-dwelling...
- 哎呀，你这个卑鄙无耻的人，
底层居住...

05:53.707 --> 05:55.431
Dang gum it! Come back here!
当当口香糖吧！回到这里吧！

05:55.500 --> 05:57.707
You ought to see what
I'm gonna do to you!
你应该看看什么
我要对你做！

05:57.776 --> 05:59.397
Ah!
啊!

05:59.466 --> 06:01.362
[chomping]
[咀嚼]

06:01.431 --> 06:03.569
First, I'm gonna do this!
首先，我要做这个！

06:03.638 --> 06:06.535
Then I'm gonna do this!
那我就这么做吧！

06:08.328 --> 06:10.397
[panting]
[气喘吁吁]

06:10.466 --> 06:13.466
- My work, my prize money.
- 我的工作，我的奖金。

06:13.535 --> 06:16.086
Eugene Krabs flies alone!
尤金·克拉布斯独自飞翔！

06:16.155 --> 06:17.500
- What?
- 什么？

06:17.569 --> 06:19.362
- Blow a kiss, jellyfish!
- 飞吻吧，水母！

06:19.431 --> 06:22.293
[chuckles]
[笑声]

06:22.362 --> 06:26.190
- Shoot. He is more slippery
than a pocket full of pudding.
- 射击。他比较滑
比口袋里装满布丁还要多。

06:26.259 --> 06:29.569
I'ma coming for my ship
in a bottle, Krabs!
我来找我的船
装在瓶子里，蟹蟹！

06:29.638 --> 06:30.569
[button beeps]
[按钮蜂鸣声]

06:30.638 --> 06:32.914
[submarine whirs]
[潜艇呼呼声]

06:32.983 --> 06:35.397
[grunts]
[咕哝]

06:35.466 --> 06:37.155
Yee-haw!
呀呀！

06:37.224 --> 06:40.259
We got ourselves a good,
old-fashioned high-speed
我们给自己一个好的，
老式高速

06:40.328 --> 06:42.293
chase and Texas barbecue!
追逐和德州烧烤！

06:42.362 --> 06:44.431
[grill sizzles]
[烤架发出嘶嘶声]

06:44.500 --> 06:46.362
[jaunty banjo music]
[欢快的班卓琴音乐]

06:46.431 --> 06:47.328
- Whoa!
- Incoming!
- 哇！
- 来了！

06:47.397 --> 06:50.397
[all yelling]
[大家大喊]

06:50.466 --> 06:51.673
- Huh?
- 啊？

06:51.742 --> 06:52.466
Hm.
嗯。

06:52.535 --> 06:54.224
Hard to port.
很难移植。

06:54.293 --> 06:56.017
[grunting]
[咕噜声]

06:56.086 --> 06:57.155
[booming]
[蓬勃发展]

06:57.224 --> 06:58.155
- Ah!
- 啊！

06:58.224 --> 07:00.362
[yelling]
[大喊]

07:00.431 --> 07:02.190
[booming]
[蓬勃发展]

07:02.259 --> 07:04.983
[beeping]
[嘟嘟声]

07:05.052 --> 07:05.983
- Order up.
- 订购。

07:06.052 --> 07:07.569
Okay, who's eating--
好吧，谁在吃——

07:07.638 --> 07:09.707
Ooh, al fresco.
哦，户外。

07:09.776 --> 07:12.224
- Ha. I was saving these
for lunch,
- 哈。我正在保存这些
吃午餐，

07:12.293 --> 07:14.983
but now is a good a time as
ever to start a diet.
但现在是个好时机
曾经开始节食。

07:15.052 --> 07:16.569
[grunts]
[咕哝]

07:16.638 --> 07:17.638
[yelps]
[尖叫声]

07:17.707 --> 07:20.983
[dramatic music]
[戏剧音乐]

07:21.052 --> 07:22.397
[inhales deeply]
[深吸一口气]

07:22.466 --> 07:24.155
[acorns whizzing]
[橡子呼啸]

07:24.224 --> 07:26.017
- [yelping]
- [尖叫]

07:26.086 --> 07:27.535
- [yelling]
- [大喊]

07:27.604 --> 07:28.983
- [yelping]
- [yelling]
- [尖叫]
- [大喊]

07:30.121 --> 07:31.155
- [screams]
- [尖叫]

07:31.224 --> 07:32.397
Clap of thunder.
一声雷鸣。

07:32.466 --> 07:33.431
Ooh.
哦。

07:33.500 --> 07:35.569
[crackling, moaning]
[爆裂声、呻吟声]

07:35.638 --> 07:36.604
[whimpers]
[呜咽]

07:36.673 --> 07:38.707
Is that all you got?
这就是你的全部吗？

07:38.776 --> 07:40.604
Hm?
Oh, no.
嗯？
哦，不。

07:40.673 --> 07:42.362
[submarine booms]
[潜艇轰鸣]

07:42.431 --> 07:43.914
Why did I ask that question?
我为什么问这个问题？

07:43.983 --> 07:46.362
- Yee-hoo!
- 耶胡！

07:46.431 --> 07:47.845
This ain't my first rodeo!
这不是我第一次参加牛仔竞技表演！

07:47.914 --> 07:51.845
This is my 500th rodeo!
这是我的第 500 场牛仔竞技表演！

07:51.914 --> 07:53.155
[grunts]
[咕哝]

07:54.535 --> 07:56.190
[grunts]
[咕哝]

07:56.259 --> 07:59.121
Ah!
[chomps]
啊!
[咀嚼]

07:59.190 --> 08:01.569
[inhales, chomps]
[吸气，咀嚼]

08:01.638 --> 08:04.017
[inhales,
chomps]
[吸气，
咀嚼]

08:04.086 --> 08:05.121
- [groans]
- [呻吟]

08:05.190 --> 08:06.604
Silly mammal!
愚蠢的哺乳动物！

08:06.673 --> 08:09.983
You forget that crabs are
stronger than woodchucks!
你忘了螃蟹是
比土拨鼠还强！

08:10.052 --> 08:12.431
[grunts]
[咕哝]

08:12.500 --> 08:13.811
- That old crab's
got more guts
- 那只老螃蟹
有更多的胆量

08:13.880 --> 08:15.017
than you can hang
on a fence.
比你能挂的
在栅栏上。

08:15.086 --> 08:15.880
[boinging]
[轰鸣声]

08:15.948 --> 08:17.535
This ain't over, Krabs!
蟹蟹们，这还没有结束！

08:17.604 --> 08:18.983
[panting]
- Hm.
[气喘吁吁]
- 嗯。

08:19.052 --> 08:21.328
There ain't no sadder sight
than a rodent
没有比这更悲伤的景象了
比啮齿动物

08:21.397 --> 08:24.397
running after her
submarine.
追她
潜艇。

08:24.466 --> 08:28.259
[crashing]
[崩溃]

08:28.328 --> 08:31.535
[orchestral fanfare]
[管弦乐曲]

08:31.604 --> 08:34.397
♪ ♪
♪ ♪
♪ ♪
♪ ♪

08:34.466 --> 08:36.121
- Hm.
- 嗯。

08:36.190 --> 08:37.569
What happened here?
这里发生了什么？

08:37.638 --> 08:40.086
- Oh, I'm still waiting for my
ship to come in.
- 哦，我还在等我的
船进来。

08:40.155 --> 08:41.948
[giggling]
[咯咯笑]

08:44.431 --> 08:46.431
♪ ♪
♪ ♪
♪ ♪
♪ ♪

08:46.500 --> 08:47.638
[brakes screeching]
[刹车声]

08:47.707 --> 08:49.638
[grunts,
slamming]
[咕哝声，
砰的一声]

08:49.707 --> 08:51.259
[all screaming]
[所有人尖叫]

08:51.328 --> 08:53.500
- You think we'll win, Dad?
- 你认为我们会赢吗，爸爸？

08:53.569 --> 08:56.259
- Hard work is its own reward,
son.
- 努力工作本身就是回报，
儿子。

08:56.328 --> 08:59.638
Or should I say...admiral?
或者我应该说……海军上将？

09:00.811 --> 09:03.017
[booming,
screaming]
[蓬勃发展，
尖叫]

09:03.086 --> 09:04.638
[fountain splashes]
[喷泉飞溅]

09:04.707 --> 09:07.914
[people yelping]
[人们尖叫]

09:13.155 --> 09:15.569
[all groan]
[全都呻吟]

09:15.638 --> 09:19.397
- [sighs] So what
do you think, judge?
- [叹气]那又怎样
法官，你认为呢？

09:19.466 --> 09:21.086
Ain't she a beauty?
不是个美女吗？

09:21.155 --> 09:24.707
A ship in a glass bottle of
epic proportions.
玻璃瓶中的一艘船
史诗般的比例。

09:24.776 --> 09:27.328
- Hm. Well, it is rather
impressive.
- 嗯。嗯，这倒是
令人印象深刻。

09:27.397 --> 09:28.776
But more importantly,
但更重要的是，

09:28.845 --> 09:31.017
it's the only intact ship in a
bottle here.
这是该地区唯一完好无损的船
瓶子在这里。

09:31.086 --> 09:33.948
I have no choice but
to declare you the winner.
我别无选择，只能
宣布您获胜。

09:34.017 --> 09:36.466
- That's right.
Hand it over.
- 这是正确的。
把它交出来。

09:36.535 --> 09:38.914
[sighs]
[叹气]

09:38.983 --> 09:41.190
- Ya-hoo!
- 雅虎！

09:41.259 --> 09:44.397
[people screaming]
[人们尖叫]

09:44.466 --> 09:45.673
[glass shattering]
[玻璃破碎]

09:50.293 --> 09:51.293
- [yelling]
- [大喊]

09:54.259 --> 09:56.569
[yelling]
[大喊]

09:56.638 --> 09:58.811
[moans]
[呻吟声]

09:58.880 --> 10:00.190
[groans]
[呻吟]

10:00.259 --> 10:01.431
[chuckles]
[笑声]

10:01.500 --> 10:03.466
- Wow, this is unprecedented.
- 哇，这是前所未有的。

10:03.535 --> 10:07.121
But since there are no more
ships in a bottle to judge,
但既然已经没有了
装在瓶子里来判断，

10:07.190 --> 10:11.328
I'm forced to give the prize
to this squirrel in a bottle.
我被迫颁奖
给这只瓶子里的松鼠。

10:11.397 --> 10:12.845
- [soft laughter]
- [轻笑]

10:12.914 --> 10:14.362
[cheers and applause]
[欢呼和掌声]

10:14.431 --> 10:16.811
Yee-haw!
呀呀！

10:18.673 --> 10:22.155
- [grunting]
- [咕哝]

10:22.224 --> 10:24.535
[hammer pounds]
[锤磅]

10:24.604 --> 10:27.500
- That temporary tree should do
until the seed I've planted
- 那棵临时树应该可以
直到我播下的种子

10:27.569 --> 10:29.914
grows into a new one.
长成一个新的。

10:29.983 --> 10:31.983
- [sighs]
Phew.
- [叹气]
唷。

10:32.052 --> 10:34.155
- Let's go, ya bag of shells!
- 我们走吧，你这袋贝壳！

10:34.224 --> 10:38.155
I want you jumpin' like hot
grease on a skillet!
我希望你火热地跳起来
煎锅上抹油！

10:38.224 --> 10:39.224
[button chirps]
[按钮鸣响]

10:39.293 --> 10:40.948
[electricity crackles]
- [yelps]
[电流爆裂声]
- [尖叫声]

10:41.017 --> 10:43.017
Sorry, Miss Cheeks.
Okay, I'll be right--
对不起，奇克斯小姐。
好吧，我马上就——

10:43.086 --> 10:44.673
[electricity crackles]
[yelps]
[电流爆裂声]
[尖叫声]

10:44.742 --> 10:47.948
Okay, I'm--I'm working--
[electricity crackles]
好吧，我——我正在工作——
[电流爆裂声]

10:48.017 --> 10:49.707
[yelping]
[尖叫]

10:52.569 --> 10:55.466
[soft jaunty music]
[轻柔欢快的音乐]

10:55.535 --> 11:02.569
♪ ♪
♪ ♪

♪ ♪